ditato"},{"codice":"gem-pro","nome":"Proto-Germanic","termine":"*wazą","categoria":"ereditato"}],"lontana":"gem-pro","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Old East Norse *waʀ, (Old West Norse ver), from Proto-Germanic *wazą, cognate to Swedish var, Norwegian ver, vær. The noun is related to the verb Proto-Germanic *wazjaną (“to clothe”) (cf. English wear)."}]}